      "text": "class smartisan_agent extends uvm_component;\n        `uvm_component_param_utils(smartisan_agent)\n       m_cfg_h / m_driver_h / m_sequencer_h / m_monitor_h /m_scoreboard_h;\n       function void connect_phase(uvm_phase phase);\n          m_driver_h.seq_item_port.connect(m_sequencer_h.seq_item_export);\n          m_driver_h.rsp_port.connect(m_sequencer_h.rsp_export);\n       function void build_phase(uvm_phase phase);\n          if (uvm_config_db#(bit)::get(this, \"\", \"is_active\", var_name))\n            is_active = uvm_active_passive_enum'(var_name);\nendclass : smartisan_if_agent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "class smartisan_agent extends uvm_component;\n        `uvm_component_param_utils(smartisan_agent)\n       m_cfg_h / m_driver_h / m_sequencer_h / m_monitor_h /m_scoreboard_h;\n       function void connect_phase(uvm_phase phase);\n          m_driver_h.seq_item_port.connect(m_sequencer_h.seq_item_export);\n          m_driver_h.rsp_port.connect(m_sequencer_h.rsp_export);\n       function void build_phase(uvm_phase phase);\n          if (uvm_config_db#(bit)::get(this, \"\", \"is_active\", var_name))\n            is_active = uvm_active_passive_enum'(var_name);\nendclass : smartisan_if_agent",
